## Lab Phases

### Phase 1 — Flat Network
Attacker and target were connected to the same Docker bridge network.
SSH connectivity between the containers was successfully demonstrated.

### Phase 2 — Network Segmentation
The attacker and target were moved to separate Docker networks.

### Phase 3 — pfSense Integration
pfSense was introduced as the intended routing and firewall layer.

### Phase 4 — Resource Hardening
CPU and memory limits were applied to the target container.

### Phase 5 — Firewall Enforcement Verification
Planned: complete routing through pfSense and verify firewall enforcement
using firewall logs.
